# Windows-first（ADR-0004）：脚本类文件在任意环境检出都保持 CRLF，
# 避免 cmd 批处理在 LF-only 下 goto/label 解析的边缘问题
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Golden vector identity directory (SPEC-506 §6: sha256 即身份): byte-exact
# across checkouts — no EOL smudge/clean, no normalization. Data files carry
# canonical JSON whose manifest records the committed bytes; conversion here
# would forge identity drift (seen 2026-11-21, ticket #172 integration gate).
docs/test-vectors/golden/** -text
